  "goodToKnow": "Die Epidemie is an epidemic; a worldwide one is die Pandemie. Germany's Robert Koch Institute (RKI), named after the scientist who identified the tuberculosis bacterium in 1882, monitors infectious diseases. During the Covid-19 pandemic, the Bundestag declared an epidemische Lage von nationaler Tragweite (an epidemic situation of national significance), allowing special measures. Stressed on the last syllable. Plural: die Epidemien."
